/**
 * REMEDIATION-PLAN.md PR 5: /a-propos/ (BUILD-PLAN.md §5 — Static: "Institution overview,
 * governance, history"). Copy is verbatim from content-extracted/fr/a-propos.md — no sentence
 * paraphrased, summarised, or extended (governance names/titles are facts).
 *
 * Two verbatim-content deviations, both mechanical, neither touching wording:
 * 1. The extracted markdown repeats the eyebrow "Oris Finance S.A" before every section (a WP
 *    theme artifact — every section on the live page carried the same client-name label). This
 *    page uses it once, above the H1, matching the eyebrow+H1 convention already used sitewide
 *    (see contacts/index.astro, nos-comptes/index.astro) rather than repeating decorative theme
 *    chrome six times.
 * 2. The extracted markdown lists "Notre Missions" twice (two heading levels, identical text —
 *    a duplicated-markup artifact) and repeats two team portraits (Bissa Mack, Djaten Arcange)
 *    a second time under the same name/role/image. Both are rendered once. The team dedup is
 *    also verified against content-extracted/images/a-propos/, which holds exactly 14 unique
 *    portrait files for the 16 <img> references the manifest counts — the extraction literally
 *    only has 14 distinct photos.
 *
 * "Quelques Chiffres Clés au 30/06/2025" is intentionally not rendered: the extracted source has
 * the stat labels (Collaborateurs, Agences sur le territoire, Clients Satisfaits, Mois
 * d'expérience) but no numbers — the live page renders them with a JS counter whose target value
 * isn't present in the static-extracted markup. Inventing figures for a bank is out per
 * CLAUDE.md's content rules, and four unlabeled zeros would read as broken, not honest. See
 * TODO(content) below.
 */
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";

import megudjou from "../../../content-extracted/images/a-propos/andre-alexi-megudjou.jpg";
